<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-RESULTS, STANDINGS IN JAPAN'S J. LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS, STANDINGS IN JAPAN'S J. LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Japan's J. League</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>    Ichihara    2	  Kyoto	4</p>
<p>    Yokohama M  0	  Osaka G    4</p>
<p>    Shimizu     0	  Urawa	1</p>
<p>    Hiratsuka   0	  Kawasaki   2</p>
<p>    Osaka C     0	  Yokohama F 2</p>
<p>    Kobe	  2	  Nagoya     1</p>
<p>    Hiroshima   2	  Kashiwa    3</p>
<p>    Fukuoka     0	  Iwata	1</p>
<p>(idle: Kashima)</p>
<p>Standings: (tabulate under games won, lost, goals for, goals</p>
<p>against, points)</p>
<p>    Osaka G	2   0   8   1    6</p>
<p>    Yokohama F   2   0   5   1    6</p>
<p>    Iwata	  2   0   3   1    5</p>
<p>    Kashima	1   0   5   2    3</p>
<p>    Kyoto	  1   0   4   2    3</p>
