<p>    Fukuoka	0   2   1   4    0</p>
<p>    Hiratsuka    0   2   1   6    0</p>
<p>(Note: Winners in extra time are awarded two points instead</p>
<p>of three and winners in penalty shoot-outs one point)</p>
